    "body": "In particular, we should snapshot all necessary state for all policies at the time \"navigate\" is invoked. \"Navigate\" is always invoked from a stable point in time (we're getting rid of all remaining queue a task to navigate cases that are relevant for this afaik) and so it should be doable to get the necessary state from the source browsing context and navigated browsing context (the former should become the source document).",
